How many years ago.
Il y a combien d'années.

266
00:24:18,976 --> 00:24:20,352
Of course.
Bien sûr.

267
00:24:20,761 --> 00:24:22,434
Why did you want it..
Pourquoi l'avez-vous voulu ..

268
00:24:22,658 --> 00:24:23,997
that?
que?

269
