01:37:37,814 --> 01:37:39,487
Coem to bed Laura Brown.
Coem au lit Laura Brown.

1114
01:37:44,694 --> 01:37:45,735
I remembered Ray, he said...
Je me suis souvenu de Ray, il a dit ...

1115
01:37:45,884 --> 01:37:48,264
